# Grant/BD submission working doc — deliberately untracked.
# Contains an unpublished readiness assessment (gaps, traction caveats, TODOs)
# that should not be public in an open repo. Keep it local; see CLAUDE.md.
docs/CELO_STARTUPBANK_SUBMISSION.md
docs/CELO_GRANT_READINESS_REPORT.md

# MiniPay listing answer sheet — same reasoning. Holds the filled-in intake-form
# answers plus the unvarnished readiness read (bot/human traction split, the
# never-device-tested transaction flow, PageSpeed variance). Local-only.
docs/MINIPAY_LISTING_SUBMISSION.md

# Store-listing screenshots — build output, not source. ~4.8 MB of PNGs that
# are regenerated wholesale on every UI change, and binaries never diff, so
# each pass would pin another full set into history forever. Nothing secret
# in them (they are shots of the public site) — they are simply reproducible.
# The capture scripts and README next to them ARE tracked: that is the recipe.
docs/store-screenshots/
